    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d406-a1-a14">

                <pb facs="0658" n="588" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg588"/>

                <head>[Enclosure No. 18.—Telegram.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">San Luis Potosi,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-06-08"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 8, 1867, <hi rendition="#italic">Twenty minutes past</hi>
                            8 <hi rendition="#italic">o’clock, evening.</hi></date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>To General <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mariano Escobedo,</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Queretaro:</hi></p>
                <p>In view of the telegram you sent me this evening, enclosing another from General
                    Diaz, the President of the republic has concluded that you may answer General
                    Diaz that at present none of the forces that are at Queretaro can go thence,
                    because it is necessary that they should remain there.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>MEJIA.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
